{"unit_id":"Sayuhs__dsh-waifu-agents#card-zh","repo":"Sayuhs/dsh-waifu-agents","commit":"fe1b06b40c9fc35c11c3632b8a22dfb51502541c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-waifu-agents 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的角色预设插件：它扫描人设目录，把每个 Markdown 文件注册成 agent 预设，并在设置页提供人设、团队和记忆管理面板。用户可以创建、编辑、导入导出和切换人设，通过命令管理当前会话，也可将一组角色组成团队进行共同对话。插件还提供聊天与工作模式、会话及角色记忆能力，适合希望在 DSH 中管理自定义角色、切换对话风格或组织多人设讨论的用户。默认从用户目录或随包目录读取人设；无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1195","panel-ops.js:899","client.js:30","team-runtime.js:1940"]}
{"unit_id":"Sayuhs__dsh-waifu-agents#card-en","repo":"Sayuhs/dsh-waifu-agents","commit":"fe1b06b40c9fc35c11c3632b8a22dfb51502541c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-waifu-agents registers Markdown persona files as DSH web agent presets. Its settings panel manages personas, teams, and memory; commands switch the active persona or mode. Users can also run a team of characters in one discussion. It needs no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1195","panel-ops.js:899","client.js:30","team-runtime.js:1940"]}
