{"unit_id":"Sayuhs__dsh-waifu-agents#feature-1","repo":"Sayuhs/dsh-waifu-agents","commit":"fe1b06b40c9fc35c11c3632b8a22dfb51502541c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-waifu-agents 的功能「Markdown 人设预设」：扫描人设目录并将每个 Markdown 人设文件注册为 DSH agent 预设。用户可通过设置面板管理人设，创建、编辑或刷新后供会话选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["panel-ops.js:1024","panel-ops.js:1239","index.js:1195"]}
